Package: com.zai.ios6aichat
Name: iOS6AIChat
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: iOS 6 skeuomorphic-styled AI chat client
  OpenAI-compatible client with iOS 6 glossy bubble UI,
  streaming SSE responses, conversation history, Markdown
  rendering and a settings page for BaseURL/API Key/Model.
  Faithfully recreates the 2012-era iOS 6 look on any iOS
  version 6.0 and later.
Maintainer: iOS6AIChat Contributors <noreply@example.com>
Author: iOS6AIChat Contributors <noreply@example.com>
Section: Applications
Depends: mobilesubstrate
Conflicts: com.zai.ios6aichat-beta
Replaces: com.zai.ios6aichat-beta
